// Title: SysKey Registry Keys Access
// ID: 9a4ff3b8-6187-4fd2-8e8b-e0eae1129495
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Roberto Rodriguez @Cyb3rWard0g
// Date: 2019-08-12
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1012
// Description: Detects handle requests and access operations to specific registry keys to calculate the SysKey
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(EventID = "4656") OR where(EventID = "4663")) AND where(ObjectType = "key") AND (where(ObjectName IENDSWITH "lsa\\JD") OR where(ObjectName IENDSWITH "lsa\\GBG") OR where(ObjectName IENDSWITH "lsa\\Skew1") OR where(ObjectName IENDSWITH "lsa\\Data")))
